cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Bioacoustics Dashboards: browser tools for passive acoustic monitoring"
message: "If you use these tools in work you publish, please cite the release you used."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Gottesman
    given-names: Ben
repository-code: "https://github.com/blegottesman/bioacoustics-dashboards"
url: "https://blegottesman.github.io/bioacoustics-dashboards/"
abstract: >-
  Self-contained browser tools for passive acoustic monitoring workflows,
  including BirdNET detection validation with logistic-regression confidence
  thresholds, clip review, and detection exploration. Each tool runs offline
  in a browser and reads audio from local disk without uploading it.
keywords:
  - bioacoustics
  - passive acoustic monitoring
  - BirdNET
  - annotation
  - validation
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-09-16"
